---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/CommonPage.astro'
import AlgorithmShowcase from '@/components/about/AlgorithmShowcase.astro'
import ToolSection from '@/components/about/ToolSection.astro'
import { Comment } from '@/components/advanced'

const headings = [
  { depth: 2, slug: 'tools', text: 'Tools' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'copyright', text: 'Copyright' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'theme', text: 'Theme' }
]
---

<PageLayout title='About' {headings} info='/en/about'>
  <p>
    I'm "EH". I currently do research at the Media Computing Lab, College of Computer Science,
    Nankai University, and I'm an undergraduate in Statistics (Data Science & AI) at Shandong
    University. My research focuses on image editing and restoration — I've worked on multimodal
    large models and diffusion models.
  </p>
  <p>
    On the contest side, I'm an algorithm competitor with an ICPC Asia Regional silver, a CCPC
    national invitational gold and a Lanqiao Cup national first prize. This blog keeps my algorithm
    notes (data structures, graph theory, dynamic programming, number theory, strings…) and my
    teardown of machine learning and deep learning internals.
  </p>
  <p>
    Off the clock I like wandering: snow in Weihai, springs in Jinan, the night wind in Xi'an and
    Harbin — plus the occasional game and a few lines of rambling. Half of blogging is archiving
    things for myself; the other half is hoping it helps someone stuck where I once was.
  </p>

  <h2 id='tools'>Tools<a class='anchor' href='#tools'>#</a></h2>
  <ToolSection
    class='mb-5'
    title='Productivity'
    tools={[
      {
        name: 'VS Code',
        description: 'Code Editor',
        href: 'https://code.visualstudio.com/',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/vscode.svg?raw')
      },
      {
        name: 'Cursor',
        description: 'AI-powered Code Editor',
        href: 'https://cursor.com',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/cursor.svg?raw')
      },
      {
        name: 'Chrome',
        description: 'Web Browser',
        href: 'https://www.google.com/chrome/',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/chrome.svg?raw')
      }
    ]}
  />

  <h2 id='copyright'>Copyright<a class='anchor' href='#copyright'>#</a></h2>
  <p>
    All original content on this site, unless otherwise noted, is licensed under the <a
      href='https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/'>CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a
    > license. You are free to share and remix the content, provided you give appropriate credit
    and do not use it for commercial purposes.
  </p>
  <p>
    Some of the images and other assets used on this site come from the internet and remain the
    property of their respective rights holders; no infringement is intended. If you believe
    something here infringes your rights, please contact me and I will remove it as soon as
    possible.
  </p>

  <h2 id='theme'>Theme<a class='anchor' href='#theme'>#</a></h2>
  <p>
    This site is built on <a href='https://github.com/Axi404/Axi-Theme'>Axi-Theme</a> (Apache 2.0),
    which is derived from the Astro <a href='https://astro-pure.js.org/docs'>Pure</a>,
    <a href='https://github.com/chrismwilliams/astro-theme-cactus'>Cactus</a> and
    <a href='https://astro-theme-resume.vercel.app/'>Resume</a> themes, featuring dark mode, i18n,
    full-text search and KaTeX rendering.
  </p>

  <AlgorithmShowcase class='my-8' />

  <Comment slot='bottom' />
</PageLayout>
